<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>LayerRail — Scheduled maintenance</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="/brand/layerrail/layerrail-favicon.png">
    <%= assets(:css) %>
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-screen bg-slate-950 text-white">
    <main class="mx-auto flex min-h-screen max-w-3xl flex-col justify-center px-6 py-16">
      <p class="mb-8 text-xl font-semibold">LayerRail</p>
      <p class="mb-4 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-sky-300">Scheduled maintenance</p>
      <h1 class="mb-6 text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight">Undergoing scheduled maintenance</h1>
      <p class="mb-4 text-lg text-slate-300">We are carrying out essential work on the LayerRail platform. Customer services are temporarily paused during this maintenance window.</p>
      <p class="mb-8 text-slate-300">Your stored data is preserved. Follow the status page for progress and the latest completion estimate.</p>
      <p><a class="font-semibold text-sky-300 underline" href="https://status.layerrail.com">View maintenance updates</a></p>
      <p class="mt-8 text-sm text-slate-400">Need assistance? <a class="underline" href="mailto:support@layerrail.com">support@layerrail.com</a></p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
